ecture and training recipe redesigned around capability and efficiency. --------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nzai-org repositories · GitHub (https://github.com/orgs/zai-org/repositories)\nciteturn29469search6 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 2 weeks ago; zai-org/GLM-V’s past year of commit activity ... •95 95 forks•1k 1k stars•21 21 issues•0 0 pull requests•Updated Mar 20, 2026 Mar 20, 2026 ... GLM-ASR-Nano: A robust, open-source speech recognition model with 1.5B parameters ... •20 20 forks•129 129 stars•18 18 issues•5 5 pull requests•Updated Feb 22, 2026 Feb 22, 2026\n\n# All\n\nSearch repositories\n\n[Input: Search repositories]\n\nSearch\n\n## Repositories list\n\n## 52 repositories\n\n  * ### zcode-plugins\n\nPublic\n\nzai-org/zcode-plugins’s past year of commit activity\n\nZCode Plugins Marketplace - official built-in and community plugins for ZCode\n\nPython\n\n•\n\nApache License 2.0\n\n•1818 forks•3131 stars•22 issues•1111 pull requests•Updated Sep 17, 2026 Sep 17, 2026\n\n  * ### GLM-V\n\nPublic\n\nzai-org/GLM-V’s past year of commit activity\n\nGLM-4.6V/4.5V/4.1V-Thinking: Towards Versatile Multimodal Reasoning with Scalable Reinforcement Learning\n\nvideo-understandingreasoningvlm+ 1\n\nvideo-understandingreasoningvlmimage2text\n\nPython\n\n•\n\nApache License 2.0\n\n•183183 forks•2.4k2.4k stars•1313 issues•44 pull requests•Updated Sep 2, 2026 Sep 2, 2026\n\n  * ### GLM-5\n\nPublic\n\nGLM-5: From Vibe Coding to Agentic Engineering\n\ncodingllmlong-horizon+ 1\n\ncodingllmlong-horizonagentic-ai\n\nApache License 2.0\n\n•948948 forks•7.2k7.2k stars•3030 issues•22 pull requests•Updated Sep 1, 2026 Sep 1, 2026\n\n  * ### SCAIL-2\n\nPublic\n\nzai-org/SCAIL-2’s past year of commit activity\n\nOfficial Implementation of SCAIL-2: Unifying Controlled Character Animation with End-to-end In-Context Conditioning\n\nPython\n\n•\n\nApache License 2.0\n\n•8989 forks•1.2k1.2k stars•1212 issues•22 pull requests•Updated Aug 24, 2026 Au